{"sourceUrl":"https://sem.hitwh.edu.cn/2026/0727/c535a216360/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:51.760054+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sem.hitwh.edu.cn/2026/0727/c535a216360/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span><span><strong>哈尔滨工业大学（威海）</strong></span><span><strong>经济管理</strong></span><span><strong>学院</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>202</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>7</strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读</strong></span><span><strong>硕士学位研究</strong></span><span><strong>生</strong></span><span><strong>报</strong></span><span><strong>名通知</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>诚挚欢迎全国各高校的优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式来我院攻读硕士学位研究生。为便于推免生申请，特制定本</span></span><span><span>通知</span></span><span><span>，具体安排如下：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span>一、基本修业年限</span></span></strong></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><strong><span>学院</span></strong><strong><span>名称</span></strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong><span>代码</span></strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong><span>学科名称</span></strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong><span>研究方向</span></strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong><span>硕士基本学习年限</span></strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><strong><span>经济管理</span></strong><strong><span>学院</span></strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>1202</span></span><span><span>00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>工商管理学</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>不区分研究方向</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href=\"https://sem.hitwh.edu.cn/2026/0727/c535a216360/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong> </strong><strong>   </strong><span><span><span><span>二、</span></span><strong><span><span>申请条件</span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>凡获得推荐免试资格的优秀本科应届毕业生均可申请我院免试攻读硕士研究生。申请者应具备如下条件：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>在满足我校接收推免生的相关要求基础上，毕业专业应为人文社科、工科、理科等专业</span></span></span></span><span><span>,</span></span><span><span><span><span>欢迎不同学科背景同学报名。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span>三、审核流程</span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>根据学校的统一安排，准备参加学院</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong><span>2027</span></strong></span><span><span><span><strong>年预选拔的推免生须通过学校“推免生信息采集系统”（网址</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong><span>:</span></strong></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span>http://yzb.hit.edu.cn</span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>）进行预报名。</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>审核时间：申请人在完成预报名后，学院将分</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>批进行集中审核。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>通知形式：学校将通过“推免生</span></span><span><span>信息</span></span><span><span>采集系统”，邮件及电话（或其他形式）分批次通知学生审核通过情况，请考生保持通讯畅通。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>具体通知时间：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>第一批：</span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>下旬（</span></span><span><span>本批次请于</span></span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>28</span></span><span><span><span><span>日前报名</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>第</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>批：</span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span><span><span>日（本</span></span><span><span>批次请于</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span><span><span>日前报名）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>第</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>批：</span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span><span><span>日之前（本批次请于</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span><span><span>日前报名）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>注：审核安排如有调整将另行通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span>四、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>考核</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>安排</span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>）考核时间与方式（考核形式以具体通知为准）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）考核所需其他材料与提供方式：申请者在填报报名志愿的同时</span></span><span><span>也可</span></span><span><span>将申请材料发送至我院工作邮箱</span></span></span></span><span><span>sem@hitwh.edu.cn</span></span><span><span><span><span>，申请材料包括：本科成绩单、专业排名证明原件并加盖有教务处或院系公章、相关证书、英语四六级成绩单等扫描件以及申请者联系方式等。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>其</span></span></strong><strong><span><span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>他</span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1.</span></span><span><span><span>所有考生（包括本校应届本科毕业生）均须通过“推免生信息采集系统”进行报名。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2.</span></span><span><span><span>全国推免服务系统开通后，将根据接收计划、报名情况等依照考核结果从高到低顺序确定录取名单。取得所在学校推免生资格且被我院录取的推免生，在规定时间内，登录全国推免服务系统完成网上录取确认。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span>六</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院联系人：</span></span><span><span>刘</span></span><span><span>老师       </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>0631-5687</span></span><span><span>844</span></span><span><span> </span></span></p><p><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span>sem@hitwh.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>其他未尽事宜按学校相关文件及规定执行。</span></span></span></p><p> </p><p> </p><p>                             <span><span><span><span>哈尔滨工业大学（威海）</span></span><span><span>经济管理</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>27</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"418115bcdc176654c47be2f50cd70a43078ba46cf7afb4d279f4c11170e49bdc","textLength":942,"sourceSha256":"1a642da9ed9bbdb4592913177f990c08eadec9ab37187d99e15e9d2aab6d1ae3","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-dad1111dd8acfa9b1a33","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学（威海）经济管理学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:51.760054+00:00"}
